{
  "format": 1,
  "title": "X3: Albion Prelude keyboard map (action -> key)",
  "notes": [
    "Controller layers bind to ACTION IDs, never directly to keys. This file is the single place that says which key X3 expects for each action.",
    "Default keys come from Egosoft's X3: Reunion manual (default profile). Terran Conflict and Albion Prelude kept most of them, but they have NOT been checked one by one against AP 3.3.",
    "status: 'manual' = listed in the X3R manual; 'verify' = listed but ambiguous or likely changed in TC/AP; 'user' = no default key, you assign it in X3 (Options > Controls) and keep this file in sync; 'app' = handled by the Android app, not the game.",
    "If you rebind something in X3, change the key here and rebuild (python3 -I tools/build_controls.py). The overlay and every layer update automatically.",
    "Key tokens use the TRASC vocabulary (KeyA, Digit1, ShiftLeft+KeyD, PageUp, MouseRight, PointerUp ...). Tokens marked 'ext' in docs/04-controls.md (Numpad*, Pause, PrintScreen) need the extended input vocabulary described there."
  ],
